---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Women Empowerment — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="Vocational training in zari and embroidery work and computer skill development for women and youth."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Women Empowerment</h1>
        <p>Vocational training so every woman can earn her own livelihood.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <p>
          Be it a man or a woman, every individual needs to be independent today. GWE NGO India
          believes that everyone should be capable enough to earn their own livelihood. But,
          unfortunately, not every girl in our country gets a chance to study or learn a skill which
          will help them earn on their own. Therefore, GWE NGO India provides vocational training to
          women so as to help them learn a skill and be independent.
        </p>
        <p>
          Zari and embroidery work garments have great potential in today's fashion world. Hence, we
          provide training in zari and embroidery work to women and girls which helps them get a
          better life altogether.
        </p>
        <p>
          Also, youngsters who have studied till 10th or intermediate but had to drop their studies
          in between if get computer training, will have a great option to grow in their careers. We
          have been thriving hard to raise resources locally to provide computer skill development
          training to youth for the last two years.
        </p>
        <p>
          Women empowerment is very much required in our country so as to stop domestic violence,
          discrimination between men and women and encourage equality.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/donate">Sponsor a Woman</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
